# DESIGN: Demo

## Status

Draft

## Context and Problem Statement

The design hop is decided from the artifact tree alone. A design file on
disk used to mean the design was finished, and now it can be a draft.

## Decision Drivers

- A draft must never credit the hop.
- A reviewed design must still credit it.

